  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed ground floor rear extension, by virtue of its excessive depth, height and siting, would result in an overly dominant form of development which would give rise to an unneighbourly loss of sunlight and daylight, and result in an unacceptably heightened sense of enclosure, as perceived from the neighbouring property, No. 225 Southbury Road. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and policies DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
